      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "ألم نشرحْ : ألم نـُـفـسِـحْ بالحكمة و النبوّة – قد أفـْـسَحْـنا",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "94:2",
      "surahNumber": 94,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "وَضَعْنا : خَـفـّـفـنا عنك و سَـهّـلنا عـليك\\nِوزرك : \\\"حِمْـلك \\\"\\\"أعباءَ النبوّة و الرّسالة\\\"\\\"\\\"",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "94:3",
      "surahNumber": 94,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "الذي أنقض ظهرك : \\\"أثقـله حتـّـى سُـمِعَ له نقـيض \\\"\\\"صَوْتٌ\\\"\\\"\\\"",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "94:7",
      "surahNumber": 94,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "فإذا فرغت : مِـنْ عِـبَـادة أدّيتها\\nفانصبْ : فاجْتهِدْ و أتـْـبعْها بعِبادة أخرى",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "94:8",
      "surahNumber": 94,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "فارْغَبْ : فاجْعَـلْ رَغْـبَـتـَك في جَميع شؤونك",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
